# Monorepo essentials

- **Package manager:** Bun only (`bun install`, `bun add`, `bun run`)
- **Backend:** `packages/backend/convex/` — import API via `@repo/backend/convex/_generated/api`
- **Shared types/utils:** `@repo/types`, `@repo/utils`
- **Apps:** `apps/web` (Next.js), `apps/mobile` (Expo Router under `src/app/`)
- **Git:** Do not commit or push unless the user explicitly asks
- **Phased work:** Follow `phase.md` in order; do not skip ahead of the current phase checklist
